WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
The write was refused. Good.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.500
And the worker kept reading.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.600
Pages nobody will ever accept.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.900
Prefill is all this machine has.

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.800
So let the callback answer.

6
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.200
It already knows: it is the write.

7
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.300
Break between two model calls.

8
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.600
Count the calls, not the answers.

9
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.400
A stub, and no GPU needed.

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.200
Twelve windows. One call.

11
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.200
And a stop that always fires?

12
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.300
Caught. That one matters most.

13
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.200
One line still has no test.

14
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.800
Stop work nobody is waiting for.
